Z||000191||poupas||06-11-2001||06:49 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DaRkLoRD:<BR><B>sleep!? what the *BEEP* is that??<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>  <BR>  What it actually is called is sbeep. Which means being able to sleep while hearing beeping noises. I just submitted it to the Oxford dictionary company along with this thread to make it a new word. <BR>  By the way, the opposite is insbeep. It is not actually the opposite since it refers to the people who have something to say but they cant because the only word coming out of their mouth is beep.<BR>  Which by the way is a newly acknowledged mental disability. For those of you suffering from this I advise you to seek immediate medical attention. <P>||||reg||1
